  "brief_title": "Study of RMC-5127 in Patients With Advanced KRAS G12V-Mutant Solid Tumors",
  "brief_summary": "The purpose of this study is to evaluate the safety, tolerability, pharmacokinetics (PK), and preliminary antitumor activity of RMC-5127 as a monotherapy and in combination with either daraxonrasib or cetuximab in adults with KRAS G12V-mutant solid tumors.",
  "conditions": [
    "Non-small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)",
    "Colorectal Cancer (CRC)",
